<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Adaptive Tool Generation with Models as Tools and Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Model Response Trace for Chess Ranking Query</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
