<span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Multiple focused approaches</span><span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> for comprehensive task completion</span></span>
